      ],
      "title": "Helping Uses",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "These verbs also appear in auxiliary-verb patterns. An auxiliary verb works with another verb or participle to build the full meaning of the sentence."
